=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Peshi Yohnts (A)} at (F-9) in the Western Encampment. Veridical Conflux #03 is nearby.
** You'll need to speak to {p:Kupipi (A)} at (H-12) beforehand if you've never done so before.
* She'll give you a {@i:Pickaxe|605} {i:Pickaxe|Pickaxe|605} and asks you to excavate a {@i:Hardened Bone|2639} {i:Hardened Bone|Hardened Bone|2639} from **Excavation Points**, or purchased on the {z:Auction House}.
** She'll only give you one so any extras from failure or repeating the quest will require your to bring own.
* **Excavation Points** are located at (E-5), scattered around the dragon skeleton. This is a little walk from Veridical Conflux #06.
** Mine until you find a {@i:Hardened Bone|2639} {i:Hardened Bone|Hardened Bone|2639}; multiple bones can be mined in a single session.
** Various other junk can be obtained rather than the Hardened Bone. There is a respawn timer on the **Excavation Points**.
* Trade {p:Peshi Yohnts (A)} a {@i:Hardened Bone|2639} {i:Hardened Bone|Hardened Bone|2639} to complete the quest.
** Note as soon as you engage her to repeat the quest a second time, it automatically is flagged in the quest log.
** 50 quest completions will max fame in this zone.

__Zoning **is required** to repeat this quest.__
